 "notes": "Kirby Avenue: printed KIRBY AVE. in the north and KIRBY near Chase; taken as continuous down the SE diagonal past Schneider. The avenue leaving Kirby SW at the fork (2690,1522), crossing Tarrant and reaching Bruce at about (2083,3225), has only AVE. printed in this strip: '?'. Street west of Kirby at y 1313 printed only ST.: '?'. N-S street x 3520 (Otte to Frederick, printed ST.) continues by a jog to Schneider, Glen Parker and Bruce, where INNES is printed (suffix not legible; 'Innes Avenue' used throughout). Unnamed AVE. from Bruce (3728,3413) south past Westmoreland, Howland Place, Pullan, Ella to Chase (3733,5152): '?'; Pitts Street leaves Chase southward 26 px west of it (3707,5152). Bruce at Kirby: west arm meets Kirby centre at about (3055,3445), east arm at (3053,3418); one cross recorded. Bruce east of Kirby has no name printed in the strip (assumed Bruce). Street along the bottom plate edge (Kirby, Gordon, Pitts, Witler, Florida crossings) printed only ST.: '?'; its centre taken midway between block line and plate cut. Glen Armand: name runs off strip, suffix assumed. Hamilton/Otte and Glen Armand lie at x 4352, just past the 300 px margin; Bruce west end at x 2083 likewise. Strip x 3855-3900 between Otte and y 900 (printed 30) and strip x 3216-3246 south of Glen Parker (lot 126) read as lots, not streets. Hemlock Alley and an alley printed ALLEY meet Florida from the west. Solid lines inside streets are water pipes; street edges taken at block lines."
}